<title>JAPAN: Marubeni to issue 10 bln yen bond.</title>
<headline>Marubeni to issue 10 bln yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Marubeni Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Tokyo-Mitsubishi Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>FISCAL AGENT - Fuji Bank Ltd</p>
<p>TYPE Unsecured with advanced redemption clause</p>
<p>ISSUE NO  8			   AMT   10 bln yen</p>
<p>DENOMINATION OF BONDS 100 million yen</p>
<p>COUPON 1.8 percent from March 14, 1997 to March 13, 2000 and 2.3 percent from March 14, 2000 to March 13, 2003</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE  par		    MATURITY 13.Mar.03</p>
<p> PAY DATE 13.Mar.97		  INT PAY  13.Sept</p>
<p> SIGN DATE			     SUB DATE 13.Mar/Sept</p>
<p> Last JBRI AA</p>
</text>
